{
 "bank": "05",
 "sections": {
  "s05C40C": {
   "name": "Layer 3 scroll and scroll sprite handlers",
   "summary": [
    "$05C40C: positions BG3 ([$22] X, [$24] Y) each frame by [$1403]. Mode 0: half-speed parallax for tilesets 1/3, otherwise it",
    "accelerates to a constant horizontal speed (+/- $40) and follows layer 1. Mode 1: vertical bobbing between Y = $30 and $A0.",
    "$05C4F9: adds speed [$1446+X] to position [$1462+X] through a sub-pixel accumulator [$144E+X]. X: 0/2 layer 1 X/Y, 4/6 layer 2 X/Y.",
    "$05C51F, $05C5BB: scroll sprite 08 (layer 2 scroll), the two axis variants; they flip direction at the turnaround point.",
    "$05C659: layer 2 falls/rises sprite; $05C69E-$05C718 is unused code (partly misdisassembled)."
   ]
  },
  "s05C71B": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 switch targets",
   "summary": [
    "Indexed by X = 0 (switch ON) or 2 (OFF): target Y, speed limit, acceleration."
   ]
  },
  "s05C727": {
   "name": "Scroll sprite 0B: layer 2 ON/OFF switch",
   "summary": [
    "Layer 2 moves vertically toward Y $0020 (ON) or $00C1 (OFF) depending on [RAM_OnOffStatus]. When the switch flips it rattles",
    "for [$1445] frames first. On arrival it plays the thud sound effect and shakes the ground (ON target only), then resets the status to ON."
   ]
  },
  "s05C7F0": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 sink/rise X range starts"
  },
  "s05C7FC": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 sink/rise X range ends"
  },
  "s05C808": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 sink/rise setup",
   "summary": [
    "Group offsets, entry counts, start/end heights, speed limits and accelerations for the two directions (rise, sink)."
   ]
  },
  "s05C81C": {
   "name": "Scroll sprite 0E: layer 2 sink or rise",
   "summary": [
    "When layer 2 X lies in one of the listed ranges, layer 2 Y is reset to its start height. Once triggered ([$1442] / [$140E] set,",
    "meaning of [$140E] unclear) it accelerates toward the end height ($0000 for rise, $00B0 for sink)."
   ]
  },
  "s05C880": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 smash X range starts"
  },
  "s05C8A4": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 smash X range ends"
  },
  "s05C8C8": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 smash Y targets"
  },
  "s05C8FE": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 smash speeds"
  },
  "s05C934": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 smash pause timers"
  },
  "s05C94F": {
   "name": "Table: layer 2 smash init values",
   "summary": [
    "Start offset and entry count of the range group, written to [$1440] and [$1441] by CODE_05BF6A."
   ]
  },
  "s05C955": {
   "name": "Scroll sprite 02: layer 2 smash",
   "summary": [
    "Layer 2 X in one of the ranges starts a smash cycle: layer 2 Y is set to $00C1 and it moves through a list of Y targets at the",
    "given speeds, pausing between steps. Finishing a cycle of 3 phases ($12 bytes each) plays a thud and shakes the ground."
   ]
  },
  "s05C9D1": {
   "name": "Table: scroll sprite follow-up numbers"
  },
  "s05C9DB": {
   "name": "Table: scroll sprite follow-up stages"
