    "05CA5C: scroll sprite 03 initial direction flags. 05CA61: first waypoint index of each auto-scroll path. 05CA68: initial [$1444].",
    "05CA6E onward: waypoint X coordinates in 16-pixel units (paired entry by entry with the Y table at $05CABE)."
   ]
  },
