    "$05CBBB: +4/-4 steps; $05CBC3: +1/-1 steps; $05CBC7-$05CBE0: constants used by unused scroll sprites."
   ]
  },
  "s05CBE3": {
   "name": "Table: scroll sprite speed and distance constants"
  },
  "s05CBFF": {
   "name": "Level end tally: long entry point",
   "summary": [
    "Called from bank 00 during level end. Sets the data bank, then runs the state in [$13D9] via ExecutePtr."
   ]
  },
  "Ptrs05CC0E": {
   "name": "Level end tally: state machine and text",
   "summary": [
    "State pointers (00-03) for the COURSE CLEAR tally, then the stripe image text and its builder.",
    "State 0 ($05CC66): gives a 1-up if the tens digit of the bonus stars matches both timer digits, sets [$13D5], appends the",
    "stripe image (MARIO or LUIGI, COURSE CLEAR!, time digits x50) to the stripe buffer at $7F:837D, strips leading zeros, advances [$13D9]."
   ]
  },
  "s05CD3F": {
   "name": "Stripe image: BONUS! star line"
  },
  "s05CD62": {
   "name": "Table: big digit tile pairs",
   "summary": [
    "Two tiles per digit 0-9: top tile first, bottom tile second."
   ]
  }
